# Virtual Wedding Guestbook

Senior full-stack work on a QR-based wedding guestbook SaaS. Guests upload photos/videos and wishes via event UUID/QR — no guest accounts.

## Tech stack

- Next.js 16 App Router, React 19 (RSC + Server Actions), TypeScript
- Tailwind 4, shadcn/ui, Lucide, sonner
- Supabase (Auth, Postgres, RLS), Cloudflare R2 (presigned client uploads)
- Resend (email), Stripe (payments — not fully wired yet)
- next-intl (`pl` default, `en`)

## Agent workflow

- Do **not** run the dev server. Verify with `npm run build` and `npm run lint` only.
- Not in production: no backward-compatibility requirements.

## Changelog

Every branch: exactly one `changelog/<branch-name>.md` following `changelog/TEMPLATE.md`.

- Sections: `Added`, `Changed`, `Removed`, plus `Manual steps` when needed
- Omit empty sections; max 8 bullets; describe behaviour, not files
- Continuing a branch: update the existing file

## Docs

Human + agent context lives under `docs/`. Start at `docs/README.md`.
